+  // initTelegram() only calls app.ready(), app.expand(), app.setHeaderColor(),
+  // app.setBackgroundColor() and app.disableVerticalSwipes?.(). The only place
+  // --safe-top / --safe-bottom are defined is html[data-embed="1"] (share-frame
